S575 tournament simplex/polygon n+2 recursion audit
==============================================================================
LRC n uses runner tournament size m=n-1.
Odd m: regular polygon is a clean rotational tournament with dihedral
automorphism+anti-automorphism symmetry.  Even m: regular polygon is a
wall with antipodal tie diagonals, so the simplex mesh must resolve it.

